  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h1> Safely and efficiently to your destination </h1>",
      "body": "<p><strong>With »powerShrink« from ZOLLER, shrink-fitted tools are quickly ready for use: thanks to the intuitive »pilot« software, intelligent induction system and permanent monitoring of the work steps.</strong></p> <p>The »powerShrink« technology ensures the shortest possible process functions. Even inexperienced operators can achieve the resulting short process times after just a short training period. The »pilot« operating software guides you through all work steps and controls many processes fully automatically. The software displays the component required for each work step and provides visual support with the help of graphic displays on the screen and the pioneering ZOLLER »actbyLight« operating concept. The light-controlled operator guidance for safe and efficient use of the »powerShrink« in your company.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "center",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c1145",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "none",
       "after": "none"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "slider",
      "header": "",
      "slides": [
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/c/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_01_1d67bafda1.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Insert shrink fit chuck, select heating parameters (manual/automatic via »idChip«)</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/8/2/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_02_7fbe9ad14e.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Shielding system: insert and align washer or »varOct« (manual/motorized)</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/f/3/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_03_59a29571d3.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Move the bobbin down to the shrink fit chuck</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/7/2/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_04_d1d6b10cb5.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Start heating process, heating progress is displayed in software</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/4/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_05_6a89d57efc.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>After the heating process, raise the reel, insert the cutting unit into the shrink chuck</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/1/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_06_c67d071d45.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Slide the receiving cup to the green flashing cooling bell and place it in position</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/c/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_07_243a8d8b98.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Cooling process starts automatically, end is displayed flashing blue</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/9/8/csm_ps_arbeitsschritte_08_eaa3a6241a.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p>Remove the cooling bell from the shrink fit chuck at the end of the cooling process</p>"
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "zoller_slider",
      "id": "c2249",
      "bg": "white",
      "space": {
       "before": "none",
       "after": "none"
      }
     }
    ]
