  {
   "type": "cols",
   "layout": "50-50",
   "columns": [
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h2> Clearly managed and perfectly networked </h2>",
      "body": "<p>The clearly structured graphic display of the ZOLLER »pilot« software guides the operator intuitively and safely step by step through the operating dialog using large function buttons and a well thought-out colour concept. The 12.5-inch monitor impresses with its razor-sharp display.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "center",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c1207",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "slider",
      "header": "",
      "slides": [
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/c/a/csm_pilot_software_home_7c48c5a9b8.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Main menu </strong>- large function areas with clear images: shrink fit chuck type selection, parameter selection or code scanning.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/3/e/csm_pilot_software_01_9cf8a9b735.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Parameter selection</strong> - the desired heating parameters can be selected easily and safely using clear and comprehensible software function buttons.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/4/csm_pilot_software_02_804c34930c.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Scan function</strong> - all parameters matching the shrink fit chuck are loaded automatically - regardless of the manufacturer. It is possible to monitor the number of heating processes and display information for each shrink fit chuck.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/d/9/csm_pilot_software_03_ce773da547.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Step-by-step guidance</strong> - during the entire shrinking process, »pilot« shows you exactly which step to take and when.</p>"
       },
       {
        "img": {
         "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/e/4/csm_pilot_software_04_1b1ee4dc49.webp",
         "alt": ""
        },
        "head": "",
        "text": "<p><strong>Status displays</strong> - whether heating or cooling, »pilot« shows you the progress of the process and important safety instructions at all times.</p>"
       }
      ],
      "ftype": "zoller_slider",
      "id": "c2452",
      "bg": "white",
